Changes from the original work:
  - Added an OpenVINO export and inference backend (laya/ov.py, OVAgent).
  - Moved shared pre/post-processing into laya/common.py (prepare_batch,
    decode_answers) so the torch and OpenVINO backends share one path.
  - Added OpenVINO tests (tests/test_ov.py) and weight-quantization tooling
    (research/scripts/quantize_ov.py, research/scripts/bench_quantization.py).
  - Updated packaging, CI workflows and documentation accordingly.

Model checkpoints (convaiinnovations/laya and related Hugging Face repositories)
are distributed separately under their own licenses and are not included here.
